{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新空いてしまいすみません(´◦ω◦`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここ最近のことを書きます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/04/27/0967712/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈の部屋にて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぁ～(´,,･ω･,,`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日も今日も雨が降らなくて\nこんなに天気よくて本当に嬉しいな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーっとお外にいたいっ！\nこんな日はどこか遠くに\nピクニックに行きたい気分♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お弁当は1人で作ったことがないから、お母さんに教えてもらいながら\n作って水筒も持っておかしも持って\nレジャーシートとチップの持ち物をもって、2人でピクニックにいきたい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう！お弁当といえば、\n妹ちゃんが4月から高校生になって\n毎日お弁当を持っていくんだけど、\nこの間お母さんが朝お弁当を作っていてどこにも行かない私とお兄ちゃんも\n作って！ってお願いして、お弁当作ってもらいました(*・ω・*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お天気が良かったから、お庭のウッドデッキの上で食べたんだ～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チップに狙われて大変だったの！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お兄ちゃんは普通に家でたべたよ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/04/27/0967712/0001.jpeg